{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48856","headline":"渡吴江 · 杜牧","name":"渡吴江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堠馆人稀夜更长，姑苏城远树苍苍。\n江湖潮落高楼迥，河汉秋归广殿凉。\n月转碧梧移鹊影，露低红草湿萤光。\n文园诗侣应多思，莫醉笙歌掩华堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}